<h1>SF Eye</h1>

<i>SF Eye</i> is scheduled for publication 3 times a year, but
has only seen 3 issues since 1992.  Nonetheless, when an issue
does come out it is well worth reading, especially the in-depth
book reviews by well-known authors like William Gibson.  A 3-issue 
subscription is currently $12.50. Write to:
<pre>
	SF Eye
        P.O. Box 18539
        Asheville, NC 28814
</pre>
